WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:11.020
You'll never find me in bed at midday.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.010
What I know now that I didn't know ten
years ago...that getting your eyebrows

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.170
done by a professional is life-changing.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:30.110
When I grow old you'll find me growing
flowers in my garden.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:35.300
When I'm in a bad mood I listen to 'The
Greatest Showman Soundtrack' or the

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:40.150
'Now And Then' soundtrack, both are amazing.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:48.640
The harder the day, the deeper and the
hotter and the bubblier my bath.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:57.680
When I want to be a badass I will wear a
blazer and heels.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:05.050
On my wedding day you'll find me
laughing and smiling with all my nearest

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.530
and dearest.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:16.840
My guilty pleasure is a McDonald's
breakfast with extra hashbrowns.

00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:23.950
The beauty product I can't live without
is concealer because I was not gifted

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:27.600
with bright under eyes.

00:01:28.939 --> 00:01:33.500
The thing is that no one ever told me
about being a YouTube star is how many

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:39.619
cool opportunities would ever come from
turning on a camera and making some

00:01:39.619 --> 00:01:43.810
videos about things I was interested in.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:48.880
Clarins bronzer
because I absolutely love those. The

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:55.479
Zoella Beauty Shower Shake because it's
a good double product for being clean

00:01:55.479 --> 00:02:01.060
and feeling moisturized so I would
probably take that and I would also take

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:07.240
my Smith and Colt Lash Dance mascara. If
you loved this video don't forget to

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.420
subscribe!

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.920
 

